# T212Ext's site for the server's shared Caddy (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "HTTPS through the shared Caddy").
# Copy to ~/traceon/caddy-sites/t212ext.caddy and put the real domain in place of the example.
# Caddy reaches the app over the "edge" network and gets the certificate on its own.
t212ext.example.com {
    reverse_proxy t212ext:8080
}
